<title>POLAND: Prochem 96 group net up to PLN 3.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Prochem 96 group net up to PLN 3.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prochem group results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						   1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		 3.53   vs    0.43 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		   5.82   vs    3.42</p>
<p>    Group net profit			 3.41   vs    2.08</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Prochem SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			 48.57   vs   53.81</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		  39.77   vs   46.33</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary profit	   0.02   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group income tax			 2.44   vs    1.33</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues	     5.06   vs    1.65</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		  4.58   vs    0.47</p>
<p>    Group investment			67.55   vs   51.47</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
